# The same two numbers at both resolutions, t=4.  The N=25 front-tracking run is
# UNFILTERED and the N=50 one is filtered, so the row-to-row change mixes two
# things; that is stated in the text rather than divided out.
corrida malha assim RRel obs
{front-tracking} {$25^2{\times}75$} 1.21281 0.04741 {no filter; $R$ set by zig-zag}
{VOF} {$25^2{\times}75$} 1.14174 0.70861 {no cusp resolved}
{front-tracking} {$50^2{\times}150$} 1.28460 0.08615 {filtered}
{VOF} {$50^2{\times}150$} 1.29072 0.08703 {---}
